#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install the Qiskit Runtime client so you can run jobs on IBM quantum "
"computers."
msgstr ""
"Instala el cliente de Qiskit Runtime para poder ejecutar trabajos en "
"computadoras cuánticas de IBM."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Qiskit Runtime client"
msgstr "Instalar el cliente de Qiskit Runtime"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore manylinux miniconda */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore manylinux miniconda */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Qiskit Runtime client {#install-the-qiskit-runtime-client}"
msgstr ""
"Instalar el cliente de Qiskit Runtime {#install-the-qiskit-runtime-client}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit Runtime is the cloud-based service for executing quantum computations"
" on IBM Quantum&reg; hardware. This guide shows you how to install `qiskit-"
"ibm-runtime`, which is the client package for accessing the Qiskit Runtime "
"service.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit Runtime es el servicio basado en la nube para ejecutar cálculos "
"cuánticos en hardware de IBM Quantum&reg;. Esta guía te muestra cómo "
"instalar `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, que es el paquete cliente para acceder al "
"servicio Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before installing the Qiskit Runtime client, follow the instructions in "
"these guides:\n"
msgstr ""
"Antes de instalar el cliente de Qiskit Runtime, sigue las instrucciones de "
"estas guías:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit). \n"
msgstr "[Instalar Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Set up your IBM Cloud account](cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr "[Configurar tu cuenta de IBM Cloud](cloud-setup).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run this command to install Qiskit Runtime:\n"
msgstr "Ejecuta este comando para instalar Qiskit Runtime:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Stay current with the latest versions\">\n"
"Periodically check the [Qiskit Runtime release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes) to see new releases. We recommend frequently updating your requirements for `qiskit-ibm-runtime` by running `pip install -U qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Mantente al día con las últimas versiones\">\n"
"Consulta periódicamente las [notas de versión de Qiskit Runtime](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes) para ver las nuevas versiones. Recomendamos actualizar frecuentemente los requisitos de `qiskit-ibm-runtime` ejecutando `pip install -U qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Próximos pasos {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - [Install the Qiskit SDK from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Run your first program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Try a tutorial, such as [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"  - Review the [deprecation policy](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recomendaciones\">\n"
"  - [Instalar el SDK de Qiskit desde el código fuente](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Ejecuta tu primer programa](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Prueba un tutorial, como [el algoritmo de Grover](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"  - Revisa la [política de obsolescencia](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
